Backward compatibility is not required.
Avoid making copies of data if possible. Try to use existing data in place.
If my prompt ends with question "Does it make sense?" or similar question, do not start making changes in the code, discuss the proposed changes first.
If the code change introduces significant increase in code complexity, present the issue and wait for approval.
Questions, reviews, analysis, and brainstorming are read-only by default.
If the prompt is ambiguous, do not infer permission to modify the codebase.
